# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VRMPet
#
# Two things here have to survive a clone with the exact bytes they have now.
#
# 1. third_party/wicked_importer/ModelImporter_GLTF.cpp is a byte-for-byte copy
#    of WickedEngine/Editor/ModelImporter_GLTF.cpp. REPORT.md section 4.4 cites
#    its sha256 as the guarantee that the importer this tool builds against is
#    the engine's own, unmodified. Git for Windows ships core.autocrlf=true by
#    default, which rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout and would silently
#    invalidate that hash on every machine but this one. -text keeps it away
#    from the file.
#
# 2. assets/ holds the avatar and its idle loop. Git detects these as binary and
#    leaves them alone, but saying so makes the intent explicit rather than
#    relying on detection.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

third_party/wicked_importer/**  -text

assets/**                       binary
